[{"id":180551381,"discussion_id":"e6b166e185baa0ebe1ee0f00b17450ee15f35143","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `dynamic_mx_quant` 量化算子中 `mxScaleQueue_` 缓冲区大小计算未对齐的问题。在 `DynamicMxQuantTailAxis` 和 `DynamicMxQuantTailAxisFP8` 两个类的 `Init` 方法中，`mxScaleQueue_` 的 block 数量原先直接使用 `maxUbBlockNum_`，现改为通过 `Ops::Base::CeilAlign` 按 `VF_LEN_16` 对齐后再计算缓冲区大小，确保内存分配满足向量化操作的约束。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`dynamic_mx_quant_tail_axis.h` — `mxScaleQueue_` 缓冲区对齐修复**: 在 `DynamicMxQuantTailAxis::Init` 中，引入 `scaleBufferBlockNum = Ops::Base::CeilAlign(maxUbBlockNum_, VF_LEN_16)`，将 `mxScaleQueue_` 缓冲区大小由 `maxUbBlockNum_ * sizeof(uint8_t)` 改为 `scaleBufferBlockNum * sizeof(uint8_t)`，保证 scale 缓冲区 block 数量对齐到 `VF_LEN_16`。\n\n- **`dynamic_mx_quant_tail_axis_fp8.h` — 同样的对齐修复**: 在 `DynamicMxQuantTailAxisFP8::Init` 中应用与上述文件完全一致的修改，确保 FP8 变体中的 `mxScaleQueue_` 缓冲区同样按 `VF_LEN_16` 对齐分配。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-17T19:41:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-17T21:32:59+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180551382,"discussion_id":"377eb9a7babbf92ae37533e0b48415f80c83f6d5","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-17T19:41:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-17T21:58:41+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180551392,"discussion_id":"438673e8c8ddb3639abbb56cfcdc359ff8458dcf","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/